## Conclusion: identical order in both versions -> under 'next start', public/icon.png has always shadowed the app/icon.png metadata route.
   Production (Vercel, 16.1.6) serves the metadata route (25648 B). Not introduced by T-006; a pre-existing next-start-vs-Vercel divergence from the duplicate file.
   The <link rel=icon> cache-buster changed format (?icon.0cdd14b0.png -> ?icon.2v7xyt03774y8.png): framework-generated, file bytes unchanged.
